Strict Mode helps find potential problems in your React application during development.

In a Vite React project, you will usually see it in main.jsx.

main.jsx
import { StrictMode } from "react";
import { createRoot } from "react-dom/client";
import App from "./App.jsx";

createRoot(document.getElementById("root")).render(
  <StrictMode>
    <App />
  </StrictMode>
);

Here:

<StrictMode>
  <App />
</StrictMode>